## TECH STACK RECOMMENDATION (Fase 1 - Web App POS)

### **Backend:**
**Django** (Python) - Strongly recommended

**Alasan:**
- ✅ Built-in Admin Panel (quick CRUD prototyping)
- ✅ ORM powerful (database migrations easy)
- ✅ Authentication & Permission system built-in
- ✅ REST API dengan Django REST Framework
- ✅ Siap untuk ML integration nanti (Python ecosystem)
- ✅ Security features (CSRF, SQL injection prevention)
- ✅ Documentation lengkap

**Alternative:** FastAPI (jika prefer modern & async), tapi learning curve lebih tinggi

---

### **Frontend:**
**React** atau **Vue.js** + **Tailwind CSS**

**Alasan:**
- ✅ Component-based (sesuai preferensi Anda: reusable)
- ✅ Modern, clean code
- ✅ Banyak library pendukung (charts, tables, forms)
- ✅ Tailwind CSS = rapid UI development

**Specific Libraries:**
- **Charts**: Chart.js atau Recharts
- **Tables**: React Table atau AG Grid
- **Forms**: React Hook Form atau Formik
- **Barcode**: JsBarcode (sudah pakai di prototype HTML)
- **Icons**: Font Awesome atau Heroicons

---

### **Database:**
**PostgreSQL** - Recommended

**Alasan:**
- ✅ Robust, production-ready
- ✅ Support JSON fields (flexible untuk future expansion)
- ✅ Better performance untuk complex queries (reporting)
- ✅ Free & open source

**Alternative:** MySQL (juga bagus, tapi PostgreSQL lebih powerful)

