### **2. CARA KERJA (WORKFLOW)**

#### **Laravel (Traditional MVC):**
```
User → Apache → Laravel → MySQL → Laravel render Blade → HTML ke Browser

Flow:
1. User akses http://localhost/project-magang/users
2. Laravel controller ambil data dari MySQL
3. Laravel render view (Blade template)
4. Browser terima HTML complete
```

**Ciri khas:**
- Backend & Frontend SATU REQUEST
- Server-side rendering
- Page refresh setiap navigasi

