#### **Django + React (API-Based / SPA):**
```
User → React (Frontend) ←→ Django API (Backend) ←→ PostgreSQL

Flow:
1. User akses http://localhost:5173 (React)
2. React load di browser (Single Page App)
3. React fetch data ke Django: http://localhost:8000/api/products
4. Django query PostgreSQL, return JSON
5. React render data di browser (no page refresh)
```

**Ciri khas:**
- Backend & Frontend TERPISAH
- Backend = API only (return JSON, bukan HTML)
- Frontend = SPA (Single Page Application)
- No page refresh (smooth, seperti mobile app)

