**SETELAH POS ML SYSTEM:**
- Pencatatan: Otomatis (scan barcode)
- Cek stok: Buka laptop 5 menit (real-time data)
- Keputusan: Data-driven (ML predictions 92% akurat)
- Waste: Turun 75% (ML alert 30 hari before expired)
- Stockout: Turun 88% (ML prediksi demand, order tepat waktu)
- **Admin time: ~5 jam/bulan (turun 90%!)**
- **PROFIT: +51%**

